  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Chillaxin on 30A, a spacious 5-bedroom, 4-bathroom beach house designed for unforgettable group getaways, family vacations, and relaxed coastal living. Located in the quiet Grande Pointe neighborhood near Inlet Beach, this home comfortably sleeps up to 15 guests and features resort-style amenities, outdoor spaces, and easy access to the best of 30A.<br><br>Just a 15-minute walk or short drive from the white sands of Inlet Beach and 5 minutes from Rosemary, Seacrest, and Alys Beach, you’re perfectly positioned for both adventure and relaxation.<br><br>☼ 5 bedrooms + 2 living room pullouts – sleeps 15 comfortably<br>☼ Bedroom 1 (1st Floor): Queen bed<br>☼ Bedroom 2 (1st Floor): Twin-over-full bunk + twin trundle<br>☼ Bedroom 3 (2nd Floor): California king<br>☼ Bedroom 4 (3rd Floor): California king + en-suite bathroom + roll away twin bed<br>☼ Bedroom 5 (3rd Floor): Twin bed<br>☼ Living Room: Two queen pullout sofas<br>☼ Bathrooms: 4 full bathrooms<br><br>Inside, the home features an open-concept living area, a fully stocked kitchen with high-end appliances, and two covered porches—ideal for sipping coffee or catching a sunset breeze. Smart TVs in every bedroom provide everyone their own entertainment space.<br><br>☼ Full-size washer & dryer<br>☼ Outdoor shower for sandy feet<br>☼ Gas grill + beach gear included<br>☼ 2-car garage + driveway parking for up to 4 vehicles<br>☼ Fast WiFi + two covered porches for lounging or dining<br><br>Closest Beach Access Point:<br>☼ Inlet Beach Regional Access<br>→ 438 South Orange Street, Inlet Beach, FL 32461<br>→ 117 parking spaces<br>→ Restrooms<br>→ ADA-accessible restrooms, boardwalk, and parking<br>→ Bike racks<br>→ Showers<br>→ Water fountain<br>→ Seasonal lifeguards<br><br>Community perks include a resort-style pool, peaceful lake access for fishing or kayaking, and scenic walking trails throughout the neighborhood.<br><br>☼ 4 adult-size bikes included<br>☼ Less than 1 mile to the beach with free parking at Inlet Beach Regional Access<br>☼ Minutes from dining, shopping, and events at Rosemary Beach + 30A hotspots<br><br>30A Beach Stays provides a few starter essentials to kick off your stay:<br>We’ve stocked the home with starter essentials:<br>☼ Full Bath: Travel Size shampoo, conditioner, hand/face bar, massage body bar, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Half Bath: Hand soap, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Kitchen: 2 dishwasher pods, 2 laundry pods, 1 sponge, small dish soap, 1 roll of paper towels<br>☼ Trash Bags: A few liners per bathroom & kitchen bins<br>If you're staying longer or need more of anything, let us know — we're happy to recommend the closest grocery or convenience stores!<br><br>Whether you're planning a beach-filled week, a celebration weekend, or just a laid-back escape, Chillaxin on 30A offers space, comfort, and style for your entire group.<br><br>☼ A signed rental agreement is required before check-in. This agreement only needs to be signed by the guest who booked.<br>☼ Guests ages 18–24 with no one in the group over 25 will be required to pay a security deposit.<br>☼ A $150 pet fee per pet is required for approved furry friends. This fee does not apply to service animals. Please let us know in advance if you plan to bring a pet!<br><br>For your safety, we have exterior cameras that record audio and video only when motion is detected.<br>☼ EXTERIOR USE ONLY ☼<br><br>DWE7605304",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
